    "lc.helpView.text1" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Setup JITLess mode in settings to use LiveContainer without JIT.\n\n**Check JITLess Diagnose page in settings if you have trouble enabling JITLess mode.**\n\nPress plus button to install apps.\n\nHolding app banner for app-specific settings, fixes and adding apps to home screen."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "JIT 없이 LiveContainer를 사용하려면 JIT-Less 모드를 활성화하세요.\n\n**JIT-Less 모드 활성화 도중 문제가 있을 경우 JIT-Less 모드 진단을 활용해보세요.**\n\n앱을 설치하려면 +를 누르세요.\n\n앱을 홈 화면에 추가하거나, 앱 설정을 열고 싶으면 앱을 길게 누르세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "lc.helpView.text2" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Check [LiveContainer FAQ](https://github.com/khanhduytran0/LiveContainer/issues/265) for common issues.**\n                         \nIf you encounter a bug or compatibility issue please submit on [GitHub issues](https://github.com/khanhduytran0/LiveContainer/issues)."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**자주 묻는 질문은 [LiveContainer FAQ](https://github.com/khanhduytran0/LiveContainer/issues/265)를 확인해주세요.**\n                         \n버그나 호환성 문제는 [GitHub issues](https://github.com/khanhduytran0/LiveContainer/issues)에 보고해주세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
